; tap2sna.py file for Pentagram. Run
;
;   $ tap2sna.py @pentagram.t2s
;
; to create a Z80 snapshot.

https://zxaaa.net/DENIED/Pentagram%20(1986)(Ultimate%20Play%20The%20Game).tzx
Pentagram.z80

--tape-name "PENT.tzx"
--sim-load-config accelerator=speedlock

; The tape is an ordinary BASIC loader, the loading screen and then one block
; of code (31390 bytes at $5E00) whose first instructions are
; DI; LD SP,$5E00; JP $AF87. The game is neither encrypted nor packed, so the
; simulated load simply ends when the BASIC loader calls the code at $5E00
; (decimal 24064), which is the real start of the game.
--start 24064
